# TypeScript-only repository

All **maintained Node source** is **TypeScript** (`.ts`). See [docs/TYPESCRIPT.md](../docs/TYPESCRIPT.md).

| Area | Location | Notes |
|------|----------|--------|
| Extension | `src/**/*.ts` | Bundled to `out/extension.js` (CJS) via esbuild |
| Repo scripts | `scripts/**/*.ts` | Run with `tsx` |
| Root tooling | `esbuild.config.ts`, `eslint.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts` | `tsconfig.tools.json` |
| ABL grammar (authored) | `parser/abl/grammar.ts` | Emits `grammar.js` via `npm run grammar:abl:build` |

**Excluded (not TypeScript):** generated `grammar.js`, `scanner.c`, vendored `tree-sitter.cjs`, WASM, TextMate JSON, OpenEdge `.p`.

- **Enforced by:** `allowJs: false`, `npm run check:typescript-only` (under `src/` + `scripts/`), `npm run typecheck`, CI `lint`.
- Do not add hand-written `.js`/`.jsx`/`.mjs` under `src/` or `scripts/`.
